# Generated API only

Files under `src/api/endpoints/` are produced by `pnpm api:generate` (Orval).

- Do **not** manually edit, add, or delete these files.
- To refresh after backend OpenAPI changes: run `pnpm api:generate`, then update call sites only.
- Cross-cutting axios/auth/error logic belongs outside this directory (e.g. `lib/auth.ts`).
